    "title": "Career Opportunity Category Manager at Droom Ventures Solutions",
    "description": "Droom Ventures Solutions invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Category Manager at our Allahabad location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Droom Ventures Solutions:\nDroom Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n• Manage email marketing campaigns and push notifications\n• Manage marketplace relationships with Amazon, Flipkart, and Meesho\n• Manage customer reviews, ratings, and return/refund processes\n• Optimize product pages for search visibility and conversion\n• Conduct competitor analysis and market benchmarking\n• Coordinate with vendors and suppliers for inventory management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Google Analytics\n• Proficiency in Digital Marketing\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Retention Marketing\n• Proficiency in Shopify\n• Proficiency in Customer Segmentation\n• Proficiency in Performance Marketing\n• Proficiency in WooCommerce\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Allahabad, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Droom Ventures Solutions!",
